{"seriesSocialInfo":{"reviews":{"reviews":[{"user_avatar":"http://p3-reading-sign.fqnovelpic.com/tos-cn-i-1yzifmftcy/196da0da3f344e65a76896a56efbe019~tplv-s85hriknmn-jpeg-v1:144:0.jpeg?lk3s=9b9bd2b1&x-expires=1795711558&x-signature=tKVKaJHjy1%2BeMZA2VJSJHo2gT2o%3D","create_time":"1769793242","digg_count":"912","user_name":"凝镜KK","rating":10,"content":"一共20个场景，大大小小31个吻，具体在第1，7，10，11，15，17，21，26，32，33，38，46，48，50，51，55，61，70，72集。[爱慕]\n我真是最近太闲了，主要也是这是我见过吻戏最多的一部短剧[爽]"},{"user_avatar":"https://p3-novel.byteimg.com/large/novel-static/71806c63daa3359f01821e86c8b9a1ca","create_time":"1752638006","digg_count":"337","user_name":"阅剧无数的短剧女王","rating":10,"content":"从头到尾甜甜蜜蜜，男主超爱，俩人基本上没吵过架，每天不是在接吻吃肉就是在接吻吃肉的路上，72集感觉每集都得亲好几次，我脸都要笑烂了。癌症啥的虽然不是误诊，但短国超能力一个月就治好了，所以当个乐呵看[笑哭]"},{"user_avatar":"http://p3-reading-sign.fqnovelpic.com/tos-cn-i-1yzifmftcy/4691409dafcb4afc8bcf379644c0361e~tplv-s85hriknmn-jpeg-v1:144:0.jpeg?lk3s=9b9bd2b1&x-expires=1795710299&x-signature=Mw226hfv%2Fzx1zIdrdy472O7BlYQ%3D","create_time":"1752670055","digg_count":"95","user_name":"喵啊咪剪辑","rating":10,"content":"是个大甜剧，曹天恺老师最近的几部剧都大方得不得了，双开门身材，八块腹肌公狗腰，还有每集都有涩涩的吻，笑得合不拢嘴了，爱看甜剧的放心冲。"},{"user_avatar":"https://p3-novel.byteimg.com/img/novel-static/3abe6a50e39b4bf1ba7c29f33074e1a8~tplv-1yzifmftcy-expand:200:0:0.png","create_time":"1752812828","digg_count":"8","user_name":"惬意的夏天1","rating":10,"content":"每集都亲亲呀~男女主颜值身材真的太可啦~而且男主毫不吝啬地秀身材~划重点:吻戏真的真的太欲啦[爱慕][鼓掌][鼓掌][鼓掌]"},{"user_avatar":"http://p3-reading-sign.fqnovelpic.com/tos-cn-i-1yzifmftcy/30e725a3c7ea447b979b8049dbacefb5~tplv-s85hriknmn-jpeg-v1:144:0.jpeg?lk3s=9b9bd2b1&x-expires=1795712925&x-signature=KV7BKhohIqqVOM1bW9MtOuRBLIo%3D","create_time":"1765897071","digg_count":"8","user_name":"自渡","rating":10,"content":"很好很好很好的剧[赞]，太甜了，没有那么多乱七八糟恶心的反派剧情，看着很舒服，真的很棒[赞]。感谢导演编剧及各位演员[送花][送花][送花]，祝大火爆火[送花][送花][送花]"},{"user_avatar":"http://p3-reading-sign.fqnovelpic.com/tos-cn-i-1yzifmftcy/67cd2ba746174bf68b6c7efc81a0e733~tplv-s85hriknmn-jpeg-v1:144:0.jpeg?lk3s=9b9bd2b1&x-expires=1795712